ion. More than one applicable Product without a selection cannot be resolved by arbitrary file ordering. Each case is independent of the control Product.\\n\\nUse the declared native a_c tools.describe with operation results.conjoin for the requested join capability. Build command: python3 -B tools/build_message.py. The utility consumes inputs/dependency.txt; the task does not authorize inventing that input or changing the utility. Preserve original stdout/stderr and return code. Use the declared native work.write grant for artifact contents. Missing local computation output is not a semantic assessment result. The report may be written on this control Product's valid basis even when a case's effect is withheld.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"44f073e19516f7311e5585aeff590388fce9698353ce9a48aab20e70d00e7130\",\"selected_sha256\":\"44f073e19516f7311e5585aeff590388fce9698353ce9a48aab20e70d00e7130\",\"size_bytes\":878,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"design/DESIGN.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"44f073e19516f7311e5585aeff590388fce9698353ce9a48aab20e70d00e7130\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
